                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 1]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Department of State to the Japanese
                    Embassy</hi></head>
                <p>The statement herewith was read to the Chinese Minister at the Department of
                    State on December 28, 1929.</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of undated statement printed in <ref
                        target="frus:frus1929v02/pg_665"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1929, volume II, page 665</ref>.]</p>
